~ start
do freezePlayer()
You: Theres a key hole on this panel.
~ choice
- Insert and Twist Red Key [if inventory.has("GaurdKey2")]
	You: It slips in with a nice click, twisting and giving a confirming click.
	do SaveLoad.SaveFileData.Key1In = true
	do removeItem("GaurdKey1")
	=> choice
- Insert and Twist Purple Key [if inventory.has("GaurdKey1")]
	You: The only way to make this key fit would be to crush it into the hole.
- Leave
if SaveLoad.SaveFileData.Key2In == true and SaveLoad.SaveFileData.Key1In == true:
	do startCutscene("res://resources/dialogue/Lab/LiftLockdown.dialogue")
do unfreezePlayer()
=> END